ontrast Art dice 6 - Copy-zSi4WBVNLu2FMplprYwhH.png-zSi4WBVNLu2FMplprYwhH.png"], "fileIds": ["a_PIJ57CHx_ovdtMVAsBp", "C50wiNWHdDyNE1KITuVC0", "RMCe6IlKiXKQx3_TDSKQi", "0zFYfTn0ndRlPHTI56wDJ", "34ssZAHrRFR3lnRp-qnzy", "zSi4WBVNLu2FMplprYwhH"], "diceType": "IMAGE", "isInfant": true, "fileNames": ["Contrast Art dice 1 - Copy-a_PIJ57CHx_ovdtMVAsBp.png-a_PIJ57CHx_ovdtMVAsBp.png", "Contrast Art dice 2 - Copy-C50wiNWHdDyNE1KITuVC0.png-C50wiNWHdDyNE1KITuVC0.png", "Contrast Art dice 3 - Copy-RMCe6IlKiXKQx3_TDSKQi.png-RMCe6IlKiXKQx3_TDSKQi.png", "Contrast Art dice 4 - Copy-0zFYfTn0ndRlPHTI56wDJ.png-0zFYfTn0ndRlPHTI56wDJ.png", "Contrast Art dice 5 - Copy-34ssZAHrRFR3lnRp-qnzy.png-34ssZAHrRFR3lnRp-qnzy.png", "Contrast Art dice 6 - Copy-zSi4WBVNLu2FMplprYwhH.png-zSi4WBVNLu2FMplprYwhH.png"], "inputArray": "1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6"}], "longTextFontSize": null}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53233127, "text": "<h2>What Next?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>When your lines are dry, you could colour in your artwork.</li>\n<li>You could try playing a collaborative game - take it in turns to add a line to the same piece of paper.</li>\n<li>Play again, but this time, the lines have to go in the same direction the dice fall - e.g. if the line on the die is diagonal, you need to draw it diagonal too.</li>\n<li>You could add new dice to the game - maybe a different set of patterns to choose from, a colour that the line must be drawn in, or something else! Tip: use the dice template inside-out to leave blank for your own patterns.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53148282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53231712, "text": "A large rectangle of card cut from a cereal box, with a range of different patterns drawn across it in a black marker pen.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "art_dice_image", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "art_dice_image-01FTX0TD97VMJTEEKXRYG42NA3.jpeg", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53148282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53231757, "text": "<h2>How to Play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Roll the die.</li>\n<li>Both players should draw the pattern across their paper.</li>\n<li>Roll the die again and draw the new pattern.</li>\n<li>Keep going until you both feel that your page is full enough. Your lines are complete!</li>\n<li>Compare your artworks - are they similar or very different?</li>\n</ol>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53148282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 53148303, "text": "<h2>You Will Need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A piece of plain paper each (or cut up a cereal box and use the inside of the big rectangles);</li>\n<li>Something black or dark to draw with (a marker pen, paint, crayon etc);</li>\n<li>Art dice - make your own by printing or copying the pdf, or use the die at the bottom of the page.</li>\n</ul>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53148282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [["